6. Risk Classification

The Vendor Owner and Information Security Lead shall classify each vendor during intake. Where more than one tier could apply, the higher tier must be used.

7. Pre-Engagement Due Diligence

Before engagement, the Vendor Owner shall submit an intake record. The review must consider the following, as applicable:

